WEBVTT

01:33.640 --> 01:35.560
So, what do you want?

01:35.640 --> 01:37.040
This time,

01:37.120 --> 01:41.040
I have proven my loyalty
and competence to you, General.

01:41.560 --> 01:43.040
I have no other requests.

01:43.560 --> 01:47.200
I only wish to continue serving you,
protecting both of our families

01:47.720 --> 01:50.960
and fulfilling my duties
as a husband and son-in-law.

01:52.680 --> 01:55.000
So, are you asking to take her place
and manage the family?

02:03.880 --> 02:05.040
I hope you can allow it.

02:07.080 --> 02:09.360
You did all this for Ms. Ji, did you not?

02:13.920 --> 02:16.160
Do you not know
the enmity between her and me?

02:17.240 --> 02:18.920
I can ensure she is confined to one place

02:19.440 --> 02:21.320
and never opposes you again, General.

02:24.080 --> 02:25.840
A weapon with leverage

02:26.800 --> 02:29.360
is far easier for you to wield.

02:35.720 --> 02:38.480
In truth, I care little
about your motives.

02:38.560 --> 02:40.760
As long as your loyalty to me
is unwavering,

02:40.840 --> 02:43.600
I will grant you whatever you ask.

02:46.400 --> 02:48.000
Thank you for your generosity, General.

02:48.080 --> 02:49.680
- You may leave.
- Yes, sir.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.280
My dear,

03:18.160 --> 03:19.360
we should go home now.

03:22.040 --> 03:23.000
Father,

03:24.040 --> 03:25.600
I admit my wrongs!

03:26.480 --> 03:27.760
Please forgive me!

03:31.160 --> 03:32.280
Father,

03:33.480 --> 03:34.760
I admit my wrongs!

03:35.720 --> 03:37.800
I beg to see you!

03:58.280 --> 04:01.080
Investigations reveal
the tribute brocade scandal nine years ago

04:01.160 --> 04:03.040
was not caused by Ji Guinan

04:03.120 --> 04:07.040
but by logistics officer Du Yu,
who broke the law

04:07.120 --> 04:09.680
and framed Ji Guinan.

04:09.760 --> 04:12.040
Du Yu was punished,

04:12.120 --> 04:14.640
and his assets were seized.

04:14.720 --> 04:17.959
Fifty bolts of silk
were given to the Ji family

04:18.040 --> 04:21.920
to honor Ji Guinan.

04:26.440 --> 04:27.600
PROCLAMATION: INVESTIGATIONS REVEAL
THE TRIBUTE BROCADE SCANDAL NINE YEARS AGO

04:27.680 --> 04:28.600
WAS NOT CAUSED BY JI GUINAN

04:28.680 --> 04:29.600
BUT BY LOGISTICS OFFICER DU YU
WHO BROKE THE LAW AND FRAMED JI GUINAN

04:29.680 --> 04:30.720
DU YU WAS PUNISHED
AND HIS ASSETS WERE SEIZED

04:30.800 --> 04:31.840
FIFTY BOLTS OF SILK WERE GIVEN
TO THE JI FAMILY TO HONOR JI GUINAN

04:42.520 --> 04:44.960
BELOVED HUSBAND
JI GUINAN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

04:47.960 --> 04:49.320
My dear husband,

04:50.960 --> 04:53.880
the stain of false accusations
on your name for so many years

04:55.040 --> 04:58.680
has finally been wiped clean.

05:01.120 --> 05:02.080
Father,

05:03.080 --> 05:05.920
Yingying has restored
your honor before all the world.

05:06.440 --> 05:08.000
Your name is vindicated.

05:09.240 --> 05:10.520
You can rest in peace now.

05:12.360 --> 05:14.080
Yaoting has joined a brocade workshop.

05:14.160 --> 05:16.000
It is the same one we had back then.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.480
He's working with Mr. Yu on the loom.

05:18.560 --> 05:21.360
Meanwhile, our new brocade
will be finished soon.

05:24.080 --> 05:25.840
I told your stubborn daughter

05:26.680 --> 05:29.320
not to investigate, but she defied me.

05:30.280 --> 05:33.200
She has endured so much for your case.

05:33.800 --> 05:34.800
It was fine.

05:37.920 --> 05:41.480
Well, it is all behind us now.

05:43.120 --> 05:46.360
Yingying, I hope
you will agree on something.

05:46.440 --> 05:49.480
No more running around

05:49.560 --> 05:50.920
and no more putting yourself in danger.

05:51.000 --> 05:52.080
All right?

05:54.000 --> 05:56.720
Very well. I promise, Mother.
No more running around.

05:56.800 --> 05:58.280
I will always stay
by your side and Yaoting's.

05:58.920 --> 06:01.440
I mean no more putting yourself in danger
and no more troublemaking.

06:02.800 --> 06:03.920
Okay!

06:08.200 --> 06:09.480
Come on. Get up.

06:15.760 --> 06:17.200
From this day onward,

06:17.280 --> 06:20.480
we will live peacefully as a family.

06:21.160 --> 06:23.040
I believe your father is watching over us

06:23.120 --> 06:24.840
and will protect us.

06:27.560 --> 06:28.800
All right.

06:28.880 --> 06:30.320
Let's eat.

06:30.840 --> 06:33.200
Tonight, you are allowed
to drink a little more.

06:34.280 --> 06:36.240
- Good!
- How happy you are!

06:36.320 --> 06:38.560
Mother, Yaoting,
can you two go outside first?

06:38.640 --> 06:40.960
I would like to speak
to Father for a moment.

06:44.880 --> 06:46.440
Are you writing more letters to Father?

06:47.960 --> 06:50.000
You are not tattling on me again, are you?

06:50.080 --> 06:51.960
Last time, you even told him

06:52.040 --> 06:54.520
about the last piece of meat
I gave to Guo Kui!

06:54.600 --> 06:56.280
Are you not worried he would laugh at you?

06:56.360 --> 06:58.760
You are a grown-up now,
but you're still behaving like a child.

06:59.280 --> 07:00.720
I will always be Father's little girl.

07:00.800 --> 07:02.120
All right…

07:03.680 --> 07:06.120
Let's not disturb your sister.

07:06.200 --> 07:07.080
We should go out.

07:22.560 --> 07:24.760
Ting, I just remembered a few more things

07:24.840 --> 07:27.320
I need to tell Yingying.

07:27.400 --> 07:28.960
Take the dishes
out to the table, will you?

07:29.680 --> 07:30.600
Okay.

07:41.720 --> 07:42.680
Father,

07:43.680 --> 07:44.640
I know

07:45.760 --> 07:47.280
this is not the whole truth.

07:49.480 --> 07:53.960
I also know the path ahead
is fraught with danger.

07:56.840 --> 07:59.160
But I have already achieved much.

07:59.840 --> 08:01.520
I founded Bloom Society

08:02.040 --> 08:03.320
and I have a group of friends
from the dyehouses

08:03.400 --> 08:05.480
who trust me and support me.

08:09.280 --> 08:11.440
Besides, Mr. Yu

08:11.520 --> 08:14.480
has agreed to weave brocade with me.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.720
Also,

08:18.800 --> 08:21.480
I have an ally in investigating the case.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.240
His name is Yang Jinglan.

08:26.040 --> 08:28.160
He may seem like a frivolous man,

08:28.240 --> 08:31.280
but in truth, he is sharp but kindhearted.

08:31.800 --> 08:33.320
He is clever and resourceful.

08:33.400 --> 08:34.880
He also has taken care of me

08:36.240 --> 08:37.640
and our family.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.320
Together,

08:42.400 --> 08:44.120
he and I will continue
to uncover the truth

08:46.920 --> 08:48.400
and restore peace to the brocade industry.

09:05.080 --> 09:07.920
FRUIT SHOP, CANDIED FRUITS

09:08.000 --> 09:10.320
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

09:10.400 --> 09:11.760
My late husband's name has been cleared

09:12.560 --> 09:15.040
thanks entirely
to your tireless efforts, Mr. Yang.

09:18.720 --> 09:21.080
My gratitude is beyond words.

09:21.600 --> 09:23.600
Mrs. Ji, there is no need for this.

09:24.800 --> 09:26.040
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

09:32.120 --> 09:34.320
Apprehending the culprit
behind the forgery of the tribute brocade

09:34.400 --> 09:35.920
is merely my duty as the brocade officer.

09:36.000 --> 09:38.280
Besides, this was not my doing alone.

09:38.360 --> 09:40.240
Ms. Ji played no small role.

09:41.720 --> 09:44.160
Mr. Yang, you take
such good care of Yingying.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.560
This is truly an honor for our family.

09:47.040 --> 09:50.640
Ms. Ji is a leading figure
in Yizhou's brocade industry.

09:51.440 --> 09:52.480
She is also my friend.

09:52.560 --> 09:54.280
I am naturally obliged to lend a hand,

09:54.360 --> 09:55.920
both publicly and privately.

09:58.440 --> 10:01.360
Mr. Yang, since you are Yingying's friend,

10:02.440 --> 10:05.520
I would like to ask for a small favor.

10:06.240 --> 10:08.960
There is no need to hesitate.
I shall do anything within my power.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.520
Please forgive my candor, Mr. Yang.

10:16.600 --> 10:18.800
You see, children in other families,
at Yingying's age,

10:18.880 --> 10:20.280
have already settled down
and started families of their own.

10:21.200 --> 10:23.280
But as her mother, I have been negligent.

10:23.360 --> 10:25.840
Both of my children have been delayed.

10:26.440 --> 10:29.600
Ting is a man,
so it is less pressing for him.

10:29.680 --> 10:31.120
But Yingying…

10:31.200 --> 10:33.080
She really cannot be delayed any longer.

10:33.160 --> 10:34.400
So, today,

10:34.480 --> 10:37.800
I wish to rely on your keen insight
to take a look at these portraits.

10:37.880 --> 10:41.040
Tell me, which one among them is
the most suitable match for my daughter?

10:46.280 --> 10:49.560
Does Ms. Ji know about this matter?

10:52.560 --> 10:56.880
Marriage has always been decided
by parents and the matchmakers.

10:57.760 --> 10:59.920
Indeed. Yes, indeed.

11:10.240 --> 11:11.280
Mrs. Ji,

11:12.200 --> 11:13.520
I do have someone in mind for Yingying.

11:15.920 --> 11:18.400
This man is neither wealthy nor powerful,
but he has modest means.

11:18.480 --> 11:20.680
He is not bound by convention,
but he is a man of his word.

11:20.760 --> 11:22.000
I believe this man

11:22.080 --> 11:24.240
would cherish Ms. Ji
and protect her for a lifetime.

11:24.880 --> 11:28.760
But can this man
take Yingying away from all this chaos

11:28.840 --> 11:30.800
and give her a peaceful and stable life?

11:33.640 --> 11:35.720
Although my husband's name
has been cleared,

11:36.480 --> 11:39.920
I heard from Yingying
that this case runs deep.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.360
There is still
a hidden culprit behind it all.

11:42.680 --> 11:44.600
If Yingying stays in Yizhou,

11:44.680 --> 11:47.080
she will constantly
face the danger of revenge.

11:48.480 --> 11:52.200
That is why the suitors I have chosen
are all from distant counties.

11:53.680 --> 11:55.160
As a mother,

11:55.240 --> 11:57.200
I do not wish for my children
to achieve wealth or power.

11:58.000 --> 12:00.360
I only hope
they can live far from trouble,

12:00.440 --> 12:01.440
leading peaceful and stable lives.

12:04.280 --> 12:07.600
May I ask when you plan for her

12:08.720 --> 12:09.560
to live far from trouble?

12:09.640 --> 12:10.640
Now…

12:13.560 --> 12:16.920
if the person you recommend
can take Yingying away today,

12:17.520 --> 12:19.960
and if they are willing to leave together,

12:20.480 --> 12:22.240
I will grant them my blessing immediately.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.480
To them,

12:40.160 --> 12:44.040
there are things more important
than life and death now.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.520
But for me,

12:47.600 --> 12:50.160
only my daughter's life and death matter.

12:53.680 --> 12:54.640
Mr. Yang,

12:55.280 --> 12:57.960
please do not think I am ungrateful.

12:58.040 --> 13:01.280
No matter how excellent this man may be,

13:01.800 --> 13:04.360
if he cannot take
Yingying far away from danger,

13:04.440 --> 13:07.200
I, as her mother, cannot agree.

13:09.800 --> 13:10.920
She is my only daughter,

13:11.520 --> 13:14.760
and I hope you can understand
my fears and concerns.

13:24.600 --> 13:27.320
Mrs. Ji, I understand your concerns now.

13:29.160 --> 13:30.440
From now on,

13:30.520 --> 13:32.520
I will bear all the troubles to come.

13:32.600 --> 13:34.840
I will ensure Yingying
is not involved in them.

13:35.760 --> 13:38.480
As for the man I recommend,

13:40.040 --> 13:42.680
I will bring him to meet you

13:42.760 --> 13:45.320
when the day comes
that he can guarantee her safety

13:45.400 --> 13:46.840
and promise her a life of peace.

13:48.720 --> 13:51.840
Well, I will take my leave.

13:51.920 --> 13:53.400
Take care, Mr. Yang.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.680
It is finished…!

14:10.800 --> 14:13.120
Rippling Grain Brocade is finished!

14:14.040 --> 14:15.400
Here…!

14:15.480 --> 14:17.520
Fresh oranges have arrived!

14:18.600 --> 14:19.800
Here come the oranges!

14:22.000 --> 14:23.880
We have brocade and oranges.

14:24.480 --> 14:27.120
Brocade and oranges…
We have a bright future ahead of us!

14:27.200 --> 14:28.640
- That is right!
- Indeed!

14:28.720 --> 14:30.360
Here! Let's dance!

14:31.880 --> 14:33.320
Good!

14:34.480 --> 14:37.000
Mr. Bai, my mission is accomplished.

14:39.200 --> 14:41.480
I witnessed it all,
from nothing to everything.

14:42.000 --> 14:44.200
My dream has been fulfilled.
This journey was not in vain.

15:11.440 --> 15:12.600
Are you not going inside?

15:16.720 --> 15:18.800
She deserves her own bright future.

15:20.160 --> 15:21.200
Right now,

15:23.360 --> 15:24.720
I have no right to disturb it.

15:26.560 --> 15:27.960
Are you giving up?

15:31.640 --> 15:32.720
Let's go.

15:47.920 --> 15:51.600
If the person you recommend
can take Yingying away today,

15:52.200 --> 15:55.080
and if they are willing to leave together,

15:55.160 --> 15:56.920
I will grant them my blessing immediately.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.040
You once said

17:06.560 --> 17:09.319
only the weak make wishes
and pray to the gods.

17:09.400 --> 17:11.520
The strong rely solely on themselves.

17:12.240 --> 17:15.839
Sheng, have you forgotten
why we came to Yizhou?

17:15.920 --> 17:18.760
Are you truly giving up
because of Ji Yingying?

17:20.400 --> 17:23.400
Are you questioning me?

17:24.200 --> 17:25.720
I am just worried.

17:25.800 --> 17:27.520
Sheng, you think you are the bait,

17:28.319 --> 17:31.520
but in the end,
you might be the one that is hooked

17:32.200 --> 17:35.560
and struggling in the sea of love.

17:35.640 --> 17:36.720
How insolent!

17:36.800 --> 17:41.120
Do you remember what you said
before joining the Bai family?

17:44.680 --> 17:45.640
Tell me.

17:50.280 --> 17:51.440
Once I joined the Bai household,

17:53.320 --> 17:54.880
I would leave my past behind,

17:56.840 --> 17:58.640
become nothing more than a subordinate,

17:59.920 --> 18:01.600
and follow your orders without question.

18:01.680 --> 18:04.160
You must set out in three days.

18:04.240 --> 18:06.400
Take everything
we have procured and go back.

18:07.480 --> 18:09.080
Prepare the grounds as instructed.

18:09.160 --> 18:11.440
Do not come back without my command.

18:12.160 --> 18:14.560
As for the tribute brocade case,

18:14.640 --> 18:16.440
Yang Jinglan will not stop

18:16.520 --> 18:18.240
after he has uncovered
the logistics officer.

18:18.320 --> 18:19.960
The family must remain vigilant.

18:25.400 --> 18:28.200
Do you understand, Ms. Ning?

18:28.720 --> 18:31.440
Yes, I understand.

18:37.120 --> 18:38.120
Is everything prepared?

18:39.400 --> 18:40.840
Are you truly going to Nanzhao?

18:44.920 --> 18:47.000
Though the past few years
have been peaceful,

18:47.080 --> 18:50.280
there is no telling
when conflict might break out again.

18:51.040 --> 18:54.400
Moreover, if they really
are colluding with Niu Jin,

18:55.240 --> 18:56.520
it is a place too far from our reach.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.720
You are walking straight into a trap.

19:01.560 --> 19:04.120
I think this might just be a coincidence.

19:05.360 --> 19:06.760
Should we further…

19:08.400 --> 19:09.800
Since when did you become so talkative?

19:11.200 --> 19:12.200
What are you looking for?

19:15.600 --> 19:16.440
Found it.

19:17.720 --> 19:18.560
Here, take this.

19:19.160 --> 19:20.040
What is it?

19:21.200 --> 19:22.760
My senior once told me that

19:22.840 --> 19:26.600
you are someone
who loves reading more than anything.

19:26.680 --> 19:28.520
Your lifelong ambition
is to become the top scholar.

19:28.600 --> 19:32.240
But since you came with me to Yizhou,
I have not seen you touch a single book.

19:32.320 --> 19:33.800
That will not do.
You had better read more.

19:34.680 --> 19:36.440
If I do not make it back

19:37.240 --> 19:38.480
from this trip,

19:38.560 --> 19:42.080
you will head straight back to Chang'an
and take the imperial exams!

19:43.480 --> 19:44.360
I am not studying

19:44.440 --> 19:45.960
because I promised Master
I would stay here

19:46.040 --> 19:47.120
to help you with the case.

19:47.200 --> 19:49.520
If it is not solved, I will not study.

19:50.840 --> 19:53.160
Besides, I am an idiot.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.040
I am not good at multitasking.

19:55.120 --> 19:58.320
So, you had better make sure
you come back safe and sound.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.480
Let me ask you this one last time.

20:01.000 --> 20:02.280
Must you go?

20:03.600 --> 20:04.920
Where are you going?

20:07.440 --> 20:08.480
Ms. Ji.

20:12.760 --> 20:14.520
A place. Why are you here?

20:15.360 --> 20:19.160
Our new brocade is finished.
I am here to share the good fortune.

20:21.760 --> 20:24.720
After all the twists and turns,
things finally turned out as hoped.

20:24.800 --> 20:25.840
Thank you, Ms. Ji.

20:26.800 --> 20:29.160
I have something I must attend to.
Please excuse me.

20:44.680 --> 20:46.760
My father's exoneration
is all thanks to you.

20:46.840 --> 20:48.480
My mother asked me to bring this gift.

20:49.800 --> 20:50.960
No need for such formalities.

20:52.320 --> 20:55.240
The items in that box were prepared
by my mother and Yaoting.

21:01.440 --> 21:04.240
This sword tassel is a gift from me.

21:08.520 --> 21:10.000
I asked for blessings at the temple.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.600
I prayed for your safety and success.

21:16.520 --> 21:18.200
This is made
from Ripple Brocade, is it not?

21:19.560 --> 21:20.880
You recognized it.

21:21.560 --> 21:23.240
Such a precious item.

21:24.040 --> 21:26.480
Is this not considered bribery?
I am not sure I dare accept.

21:27.800 --> 21:29.480
Then give me money and consider it bought.

21:35.240 --> 21:38.040
This kind of thing is priceless.

21:40.000 --> 21:41.400
No matter what I offer,

21:43.320 --> 21:44.760
it would not be enough.

21:46.720 --> 21:50.560
Then, think of it as a down payment
for securing my safety.

21:54.040 --> 21:57.560
But can this man
take Yingying away from all this chaos

21:57.640 --> 21:59.960
and give her a peaceful and stable life?

22:14.720 --> 22:17.080
Ms. Ji, you and I are allies.

22:17.160 --> 22:20.240
It is our mutual responsibility
to benefit each other.

22:21.080 --> 22:23.240
But you gave me such a valuable gift.

22:23.840 --> 22:26.640
I truly do not know
how I can repay this favor.

22:34.960 --> 22:36.080
Repay the favor?

22:42.920 --> 22:44.160
Am I just an ally

22:45.640 --> 22:47.040
to you?

22:56.920 --> 22:57.920
For now, that is all we can be.

22:58.000 --> 22:59.280
What happened?

23:00.160 --> 23:01.840
Nothing happened.

23:02.600 --> 23:05.920
I have just realized
I have acted recklessly in the past.

23:06.000 --> 23:07.760
I might have inadvertently
offended you, Ms. Ji.

23:30.880 --> 23:31.800
Wait!

23:41.880 --> 23:43.360
I will be busy for a while.

23:45.080 --> 23:46.600
Take care of yourself.

23:47.600 --> 23:50.520
If anything happens,
send word to Brocade Bureau.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.480
Do not try to handle it all on your own.

23:53.920 --> 23:55.040
One more thing.

23:56.480 --> 24:00.000
Although Niu Jin has used
the excuse of assisting in the war

24:00.080 --> 24:01.880
to leave Yizhou temporarily,

24:02.400 --> 24:04.960
he has surely left plenty of his men
behind in the city.

24:06.440 --> 24:08.520
It is easier to dodge a visible bow
than to guard against a hidden strike.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.560
Be cautious.

24:13.000 --> 24:15.920
Do not take
unnecessary risks in the future.

24:16.760 --> 24:19.120
Never ever bet everything
on a single move again.

24:20.480 --> 24:21.480
Yang Jinglan,

24:22.840 --> 24:24.800
are you out of your mind?

24:40.440 --> 24:41.440
If we are mere allies,

24:42.840 --> 24:44.040
why bother crossing the line?

25:33.920 --> 25:35.600
Do you want to ask me the reason

25:37.120 --> 25:38.520
why I still act like I do not like her

25:40.000 --> 25:41.040
when I do?

25:41.800 --> 25:43.200
I know you are going to say

25:43.280 --> 25:46.400
there are more important things
in this world than love.

25:46.920 --> 25:48.280
For example, peace and safety.

25:50.040 --> 25:51.800
Your path is fraught with peril.

25:53.480 --> 25:55.560
You have no right to make promises to her.

25:56.280 --> 25:59.080
Then, why did you promise to protect her?

26:01.920 --> 26:03.560
The promises you make to an ally

26:04.880 --> 26:06.440
are not the same as the promises you make

26:07.800 --> 26:09.160
to the one you love.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.240
What is the difference?

26:12.880 --> 26:14.280
If she is an ally,

26:17.240 --> 26:19.800
I will fight to the death to protect her.

26:22.640 --> 26:24.080
But if she is the one I love,

26:27.280 --> 26:28.880
I must live well.

26:32.440 --> 26:33.440
I must live and stay by her side

26:35.880 --> 26:38.280
and share this mundane, imperfect world

26:41.840 --> 26:43.480
with her.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.480
Have you made preparations
for me to leave?

27:00.560 --> 27:03.000
The matter of the logistics officer
is serious.

27:03.600 --> 27:05.880
It makes sense for a brocade officer
to report back to Chang'an.

27:05.960 --> 27:08.240
I will impersonate you
and head to Chang'an.

27:08.320 --> 27:09.160
Just focus on heading to Nanzhao.

27:10.200 --> 27:12.520
I have prepared the maps and rations.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.120
When do you want to leave?

27:30.920 --> 27:32.560
Ally?

27:34.080 --> 27:35.600
What a fool you are!

27:36.680 --> 27:38.240
- You like him.
- Who likes him?

27:39.520 --> 27:41.120
Then, why are you running away from home?

27:41.200 --> 27:43.360
I do not want to go on blind dates!
It is because of him.

27:43.440 --> 27:45.880
Whether you two end up together
is not just up to him.

27:45.960 --> 27:46.880
It is up to you.

27:47.800 --> 27:49.640
If you like him, stay close to him.

27:49.720 --> 27:51.560
If you do not like him, just walk away.

27:51.640 --> 27:53.080
What he thinks does not matter.

27:54.080 --> 27:56.040
I gave him a sword tassel.
Was that not obvious enough?

27:56.640 --> 27:59.120
If he does not like me,
why should I cling to him?

27:59.640 --> 28:01.560
Yingying? Yingying!

28:01.640 --> 28:04.640
First, I am not going home.
Second, I am not going on blind dates.

28:06.040 --> 28:07.200
I…

28:08.720 --> 28:09.720
Well, I…

28:10.280 --> 28:12.520
- I am here, not because…
- Wait a second.

28:14.600 --> 28:15.560
You drove her away.

28:15.640 --> 28:17.120
You had better finish
the work she left behind.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.720
All right.

28:28.480 --> 28:30.200
What are the things in that bundle?

28:30.280 --> 28:32.560
Yingying is determined
to stand her ground against our mother.

28:33.080 --> 28:36.520
I figured she would
be staying with you for a while,

28:36.600 --> 28:38.920
so I packed her some clothes
and necessities.

28:39.000 --> 28:41.000
I did not expect you to be so thoughtful.

28:42.080 --> 28:45.320
So, you are not here
to drag her back for the blind dates?

28:46.600 --> 28:48.200
She has a mind of her own.

28:48.280 --> 28:51.320
If it is not someone she truly admires,
she would rather never marry.

28:52.240 --> 28:55.400
As her brother,
I only want her to be happy.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.200
How can I force her into something
she does not want?

28:59.080 --> 29:01.360
You understand her so well.

29:01.440 --> 29:03.680
But why does your mother keep pushing her?

29:05.360 --> 29:08.040
But not every woman

29:08.120 --> 29:10.720
truly knows what she likes
or what she wants.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.440
Well…

29:13.240 --> 29:14.720
For instance,

29:15.240 --> 29:18.760
do you know
what kind of man you like, Yuniang?

29:20.400 --> 29:21.680
I thought we were talking about Yingying.

29:21.760 --> 29:23.080
How did this conversation
suddenly turn to me?

29:24.800 --> 29:27.680
I was just… casually asking.

29:29.800 --> 29:31.320
I like all kinds of men!

29:32.120 --> 29:35.280
I like those with handsome looks
and strong build.

29:35.360 --> 29:38.400
I also like those who are rich and witty.

29:39.000 --> 29:40.160
It is best to have wealth and power

29:41.040 --> 29:42.080
and no parents to interfere!

29:44.160 --> 29:48.760
But no one could possibly have
all those traits at once.

29:48.840 --> 29:50.640
- Could it be…?
- That is why I do not plan to remarry.

29:52.600 --> 29:53.880
As long as I stay single,

29:53.960 --> 29:56.560
I can admire any fine young man,

29:56.640 --> 29:58.640
appreciate him, and even tease him.

30:02.760 --> 30:04.920
- You really do not plan to marry again?
- No.

30:05.000 --> 30:07.240
Being a bride once was enough.
It is boring.

30:16.680 --> 30:19.920
Yuniang, please take care of Yingying.

30:20.000 --> 30:21.600
I have got some matters
to attend to at home.

30:21.680 --> 30:23.000
I will leave first.

30:53.240 --> 30:54.600
Do you really not like Yaoting?

30:55.840 --> 30:58.240
- He is just fine.
- What is that supposed to mean?

31:00.440 --> 31:02.040
I enjoy his company.

31:02.800 --> 31:03.720
But he is not someone
I cannot live without.

31:04.760 --> 31:08.200
There are things more important than love,

31:08.280 --> 31:10.360
such as freedom and joy.

31:11.160 --> 31:13.080
That is not what
you were saying to me earlier!

31:14.680 --> 31:16.520
People can justify anything with words,

31:17.120 --> 31:19.440
and every path in life
can eventually reach its end.

31:20.400 --> 31:21.360
So, Yingying,

31:22.320 --> 31:24.000
stop listening to what others say.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.720
You should ask yourself more often.

31:34.400 --> 31:37.200
It is the second watch of the Hai hour.
Lock your doors, close your windows,

31:37.280 --> 31:38.960
and guard against thieves!

31:49.160 --> 31:50.720
I will rely on myself

31:50.800 --> 31:53.760
to protect you
through storms and blades, Ms. Ji.

32:01.520 --> 32:02.640
From this day forward,

32:02.720 --> 32:04.560
you will no longer bear the name
of a disgraced family.

32:05.160 --> 32:08.760
Your father remains the noble
and righteous Brocade Master.

32:17.200 --> 32:19.200
Our lives are intertwined.

32:19.280 --> 32:21.280
Our trust is exchanged for loyalty.

32:21.800 --> 32:23.920
What ally could ever offer such devotion?

32:55.400 --> 32:58.200
But he is not one
to play games or deceive.

32:59.240 --> 33:01.560
No, I must know the truth!

33:12.360 --> 33:13.840
It is already late.

33:13.920 --> 33:15.120
Ji Yingying,

33:15.200 --> 33:17.680
if you wake up tomorrow feeling the same,

33:17.760 --> 33:19.760
go ask him about it directly.

33:19.840 --> 33:21.240
No more tormenting yourself with doubt.

33:42.280 --> 33:43.200
Take care.

33:47.520 --> 33:52.400
BROCADE BUREAU

33:53.000 --> 33:54.080
Ms. Ji.

34:02.920 --> 34:05.440
He has gone to Nanzhao.
He left less than half an hour ago.

34:05.520 --> 34:08.239
Ms. Ji, if you hurry,
you can still catch up with him.

34:15.719 --> 34:17.560
Mister, faster! Please!

34:24.040 --> 34:25.800
Stop…!

35:24.680 --> 35:25.800
Yingying…

35:26.760 --> 35:27.760
Wait for me.

35:41.720 --> 35:45.120
Yang Jinglan,
I will wait for you to return!

36:08.720 --> 36:09.560
Master.

36:10.960 --> 36:12.000
Listen to me.

36:12.080 --> 36:13.880
Send someone to infiltrate
the Yu residence.

36:13.960 --> 36:17.120
Have them copy
the Rippling Grain Brocade pattern.

36:18.400 --> 36:22.480
I want a complete list of every craftsman
in the entire Yizhou.

36:23.280 --> 36:24.320
Yes, sir.

36:26.040 --> 36:27.800
As for Zhao Xiuyuan,

36:27.880 --> 36:30.880
if he seeks me out,
bring him directly to me.

36:31.760 --> 36:32.800
Zhao Xiuyuan?

36:33.720 --> 36:35.600
Master, do you wish
to collaborate with him?

36:35.680 --> 36:37.160
Leveraging the Yu family

36:37.240 --> 36:39.320
and pitting the Zhao family
against the Yang family

36:39.400 --> 36:41.360
is an excellent strategy.

36:41.440 --> 36:42.680
Besides,

36:42.760 --> 36:44.400
Zhao Xiuyuan and I
share one thing in common.

36:44.480 --> 36:46.240
We will not let go of Ji Yingying.

36:46.320 --> 36:48.080
So, why not work together?

36:48.160 --> 36:49.000
Understood.

36:59.360 --> 37:00.240
Ms. Niu!

37:01.720 --> 37:02.560
Yu Yuan?

37:02.640 --> 37:06.280
Zhao Xiuyuan has you confined here.
You have suffered enough.

37:07.040 --> 37:09.600
There are guards watching at all hours.
The place is fortified.

37:09.680 --> 37:10.520
How did you get inside?

37:10.600 --> 37:11.960
I found a way.

37:12.800 --> 37:14.200
As long as I can see you,

37:15.200 --> 37:16.480
I will be at ease.

37:17.360 --> 37:18.720
You foolish girl.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.240
You have endured so much.

37:25.560 --> 37:26.440
Come here.

37:28.840 --> 37:31.840
What should we do next, Ms. Niu?

37:31.920 --> 37:33.240
How can I get you out of here?

37:35.280 --> 37:36.640
What is happening outside?

37:38.000 --> 37:41.080
The general has requested
to lead troops to the southwest front.

37:41.800 --> 37:44.600
Half of the forces in the city
have been handed to Zhao Xiuyuan.

37:44.680 --> 37:46.920
The other half
remains in the Niu residence

37:47.000 --> 37:48.240
under the butler's command.

37:50.960 --> 37:53.360
My dear father is always quick
to dodge responsibility.

37:55.160 --> 37:56.480
How about Ji Yingying and Yang Jinglan?

37:56.560 --> 37:58.960
Bloom Society has completed
its Ripple Brocade.

37:59.040 --> 38:01.040
They are now
publicly selling it across the city

38:01.120 --> 38:02.280
with great fanfare.

38:03.760 --> 38:06.320
Yang Jinglan has returned to Chang'an

38:06.400 --> 38:07.560
to report on the matter
of the logistics officer.

38:08.480 --> 38:10.360
How about Zhao Xiuyuan? What is he doing?

38:11.000 --> 38:11.920
Nothing.

38:14.120 --> 38:15.760
Has he made any move against Ji Yingying?

38:17.360 --> 38:18.640
No, he has not.

38:18.720 --> 38:21.400
For the past few days,
Mr. Zhao stayed in the house

38:21.480 --> 38:22.600
and handled family matters.

38:23.480 --> 38:25.200
He did not even attend

38:25.280 --> 38:26.600
the event where Ji Yingying
unveiled her new brocade.

38:27.600 --> 38:28.880
Miss,

38:28.960 --> 38:31.760
has he truly given up on Ji Yingying?

38:34.040 --> 38:35.840
In the past, he had nothing,

38:36.360 --> 38:37.840
yet he still refused to let go.

38:39.760 --> 38:41.760
Now, he has power in his hands,

38:42.480 --> 38:44.360
so there is no way
he will give up so easily.

38:46.880 --> 38:48.080
Right now,

38:48.160 --> 38:50.440
we need someone to give him a push

38:51.240 --> 38:53.400
and pierce through
his final layer of hypocrisy.

38:54.720 --> 38:56.080
What do you need me to do?

38:59.200 --> 39:03.600
Find a way to bring Mrs. Zhao to see me.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.480
Mother.

39:19.600 --> 39:23.240
If you must drink,
go do it at a business discussion.

39:23.760 --> 39:25.240
What is the point of sulking here?

39:27.200 --> 39:28.160
Mother,

39:29.200 --> 39:31.840
all business matters have been delegated.

39:32.560 --> 39:34.000
Everything is under control.

39:35.040 --> 39:36.440
A little drink will not cause harm.

39:36.520 --> 39:38.200
Will it not cause harm?

39:38.960 --> 39:41.040
You cannot even hold
this wine jug steadily.

39:41.560 --> 39:44.560
How will you draw patterns
or throw the shuttle to weave brocade?

39:45.480 --> 39:47.800
I used to weave brocade
for one person alone,

39:48.400 --> 39:50.480
but now that they are gone,

39:52.680 --> 39:54.520
what meaning is there in weaving anymore?

39:57.440 --> 40:00.160
You are still pining
for Ji Yingying, right?

40:02.040 --> 40:03.120
Then, marry her!

40:05.520 --> 40:07.800
With Bloom Society's recent success,

40:08.600 --> 40:10.600
she is more than worthy
of becoming part of our family now.

40:13.520 --> 40:17.640
But she no longer wants to marry me.

40:19.560 --> 40:23.600
I used to claim everything I did
was for her.

40:24.200 --> 40:25.440
But in the end,

40:27.960 --> 40:29.520
I was the one who hurt her the most.

40:31.000 --> 40:32.120
Mother,

40:33.600 --> 40:35.000
I do not deserve her.

40:35.600 --> 40:39.360
Marriage is decided by parents
and matchmakers.

40:40.200 --> 40:42.080
Once she becomes your wife,

40:42.160 --> 40:44.120
she will come to terms with it
sooner or later.

40:52.360 --> 40:54.520
Why bring this up now, Mother?

40:55.960 --> 40:59.120
Now, Ms. Ji has joined
forces with the Yu family

40:59.200 --> 41:00.040
to create the new brocade.

41:00.640 --> 41:01.880
They are stealing the spotlight.

41:02.920 --> 41:04.520
Yet, my husband sits idly by,

41:05.040 --> 41:07.040
allowing the Zhao family
to be overshadowed.

41:07.640 --> 41:09.440
He is indulging in these trivial feelings.

41:09.520 --> 41:11.080
How can he achieve greatness?

41:11.760 --> 41:14.600
How can he secure his position
as the patriarch of the family

41:14.680 --> 41:16.000
and gain my father's trust?

41:17.320 --> 41:20.280
So, I am willing
to let him take another bride

41:21.000 --> 41:22.680
to settle this lingering matter
in his heart.

41:24.480 --> 41:26.680
But Xiuyuan is simply too stubborn.

41:26.760 --> 41:28.000
If he is unwilling,

41:28.600 --> 41:31.560
I am afraid even I
will not be able to persuade him.

41:31.640 --> 41:34.560
My husband's heart is as hard as stone.

41:35.680 --> 41:38.520
Ordinary words will not sway him,

41:39.480 --> 41:42.240
but I do have something in mind

41:43.000 --> 41:45.320
that you can say to him.

41:48.360 --> 41:51.160
I cannot bear to see you so defeated.

41:53.080 --> 41:55.840
Lost business can be won back.

41:55.920 --> 41:57.800
And so can love.

41:58.960 --> 42:01.960
If a man truly desires a woman,

42:02.760 --> 42:04.000
all it takes is the resolve to act.

42:05.080 --> 42:06.840
It will not be that difficult.

42:07.440 --> 42:09.200
If you truly care for her,

42:09.960 --> 42:11.720
can you not muster
even a shred of courage?

42:13.160 --> 42:15.840
How long has she known Yang Jinglan

42:16.800 --> 42:18.600
compared to the time
she has spent with you?

42:19.280 --> 42:20.840
Are you really willing

42:21.360 --> 42:23.600
to let someone else take
the flower you have nurtured

42:24.120 --> 42:25.760
with your own hands?

42:25.840 --> 42:27.320
I cannot accept it!

42:28.680 --> 42:30.040
Mother, you do not understand.

42:30.120 --> 42:32.960
That boy is unreliable.

42:34.000 --> 42:36.880
I worry every day that Yingying
will suffer under his care!

42:36.960 --> 42:38.800
Then take her back!

42:39.320 --> 42:41.000
She belongs to you in the first place!
